  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b1a85d18-1273-4083-8851-5039e3ee56bc-image.png\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 122px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math>Applying conservation of mechanical energy at the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>, we get<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Now in vector form.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Therefore, change in velocity will be,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mover><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mover><mi>V</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
